	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("deep_druid_reward")>><<money 450>><</if>>
	<<stress -4>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
	手上的力道偏了半寸，机关卡死，你只好退开重新找角度。<<pain 2>><<stress 4>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Extra Deep Druid 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
